OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces 'challenging' #82m
OL,4,Abudget shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is facing an #82m budget gap
OL,7,Fin the year it was due to be abolished
OL,8,Funder now-paused plans to radically
OL,9,Freshape local government.
OL,11,FMedway Council had believed it would no
OL,12,Flonger need exceptional financial
OL,13,Fsupport (EFS) from central government
OL,14,Fafter years of finding savings to
OL,15,Fbalance the books.
OL,17,FBut the authority's medium-term
OL,18,Ffinancial outlook now anticipates
OL,19,Fshortfalls totalling #360m over the
OL,20,Fnext five years ` on top of the #26m it
OL,21,Fexpects to overspend this year.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
