OL,4,Abudget shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the possibility of effective
OL,7,Fbankruptcy if it cannot balance the
OL,8,Fbooks for next year, its leader Vince
OL,9,FMaple said: "There is no denying we're
OL,10,Fin a challenging financial situation."
